legacy_device_triggers.description:
These automations still start from a BILRESA device trigger and no longer run:

{automations}

Device triggers were removed, because since Home Assistant 2026.8 the wheel's device belongs to the Matter integration alone. Open each automation, delete the device trigger and add one of the BILRESA triggers instead, for example **BILRESA scrolled up**, with the wheel's Channel entity as its target. This notice disappears once no automation uses a device trigger.
